# Vehicle photo provider configuration (optional).
#
# The app resolves real car photos from Wikimedia Commons (primary) and
# Wikipedia article lead images (secondary). Neither requires an API key —
# leave the variables below empty in local development.
#
# If you self-host or cache the API endpoints (e.g. for rate limiting /
# offline development), point the variables at your own endpoints:
#
# CAR_IMAGE_WIKIMEDIA_API=https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/api.php
# CAR_IMAGE_WIKIPEDIA_API=https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php
#
# Reserved for future keyed photo providers (e.g. a commercial image API).
# NEVER commit a real key; put it in .env.local instead.
CAR_IMAGE_API_KEY=